<SMSLayout title="SMS Terms & Conditions" description="JenkinsHQ text messaging terms, opt-out and support instructions.">
<p class="overline">JenkinsHQ</p><h1>SMS Terms & Conditions</h1><p class="muted">Last updated November 7, 2026</p>
<h2>JenkinsHQ customer notification program</h2><p>After voluntarily checking the SMS consent box on the <a href="/jenkinshq/sms">JenkinsHQ web form</a> and providing a valid mobile number, you agree to receive non-marketing SMS notifications from JenkinsHQ about customer service requests, order confirmations and fulfillment updates, appointment reminders, and responses to support inquiries. Consent is not a condition of purchasing goods or services.</p>
<h2>Frequency and rates</h2><p>Message frequency varies according to your service activity. Message and data rates may apply. Check your mobile plan for rates.</p>
<h2>Opt out</h2><p>Text <strong>STOP</strong> in response to any JenkinsHQ program text to opt out. You may receive a single confirmation of your opt-out. No further program texts will be sent unless you explicitly opt in again.</p>
<h2>Help and customer support</h2><p>Text <strong>HELP</strong> for assistance, or email <a href="mailto:Jeremi.Jenkins@gmail.com">Jeremi.Jenkins@gmail.com</a>.</p>
<h2>Carrier disclaimer</h2><p>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. Delivery depends on your mobile service, connectivity, and participating networks.</p>
<h2>Privacy</h2><p>Read the <a href="/jenkinshq/privacy">JenkinsHQ Privacy Policy</a> for details on information collected through the SMS program and our commitment not to share mobile opt-in data for third-party marketing.</p>
<h2>Updates</h2><p>These terms may be revised; updated terms will appear here. Separate agreements may apply to purchased products or services.</p>
</SMSLayout>